Guests & Initrds (Nix):
  nix build .#guest-raft   Build Raft guest binary
  nix build .#initrd-raft  Build Raft initrd image
  nix build .#guest-sdk    Build SDK guest binary
  nix build .#guest-net    Build net guest binary

Exploration:
  nix run .#explore-raft   Run Raft exploration (builds everything)
  nix run .#explore        Run explorer with manual args

Kernels:
  nix build .#net-vmlinux       Virtio-net kernel
  nix build .#kcov-vmlinux      KCOV kernel
  nix build .#kcov-net-vmlinux  Both

CI:
